  clock: 6  # 587f
  nonce: 587f  # 587f
  message: "this should just be the behavior. i don't see any benefit to making it a choice. if config.yaml doesn't exist, congratulations user, you get .agent/tracker/config.yaml.template. They can use it or not; we don't care. but without this implemented, they might miss it. I see no benefit in making the user make another decision or understand another CLI flag. correct me if I'm wrong."  # 587f
